<!-- ============================================================
     HOUSE RULES
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bb-sect" style="background: var(--paper-deep);">
  <div class="mw-wrap">
    <div class="sect-head">
      <div class="bb-eyebrow">House rules</div>
      <h2>The few things that will make work feel like Meadowbrook, or not.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rules">
      <div class="rule do">
        <div class="head">Do</div>
        <p>Sit content on papery cream <code>#FBF0DF</code> when in doubt. It's the safest, most "us" canvas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule dont">
        <div class="head">Don't</div>
        <p>Don't use bluish-purple gradients, multi-stop spectrums, or any kind of generated noise texture.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule do">
        <div class="head">Do</div>
        <p>Use real photography where you'd otherwise reach for an icon or illustration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule dont">
        <div class="head">Don't</div>
        <p>Don't add 1px borders, hairline dividers or stroke outlines. Use a background shift or more space.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule do">
        <div class="head">Do</div>
        <p>Pick one zone per piece. Use its colours, its display font, its motif if it has one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule dont">
        <div class="head">Don't</div>
        <p>Don't redraw the hand logo as SVG, change its colour, or place it inside a circle.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule do">
        <div class="head">Do</div>
        <p>Use sentence case everywhere except proper nouns. "Book a table", not "Book A Table".</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule dont">
        <div class="head">Don't</div>
        <p>Don't use emoji in formal materials. Informal social posts may use them sparingly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule do">
        <div class="head">Do</div>
        <p>Always show the hand-drawn map whole. It's hand-drawn, slightly imperfect — keep it that way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rule dont">
        <div class="head">Don't</div>
        <p>Don't crop, zoom or recolour the map. Don't generate AI imagery for any Meadowbrook use.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

